rl":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-28T13:21:10Z","updated_at":"2026-01-28T13:21:10Z","body":"Naturally it'll be instant without doing lookup for debug symbols, can replicate this on Linux, unsure if it's an unavoidable overhead for the lookup","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3811281574/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3811427987","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115508#issuecomment-3811427987","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115508","id":3811427987,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jLcaT","user":{"login":"cdemirer","id":41021322,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMDIxMzIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41021322?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer","html_url":"https://github.com/cdemirer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-28T13:51:44Z","updated_at":"2026-01-28T13:51:44Z","body":"Turns out `addr2line` is extremely slow. Simply recompiling with 5 chars added so that it's `llvm-addr2line` completely fixes the issue for me (though `llvm-addr2line` might not be installed on every system I guess.)\n\nSee: https://github.com/gimli-rs/addr2line?tab=readme-ov-file#performance \nThe chart makes the impression that the speedup with `llvm-addr2line` compared to `addr2line` would be just a few-x, but I would say for the case of Godot backtrace it's like a 100x speedup.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3811427987/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3811561416","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115508#issuecomment-3811561416","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115508","id":3811561416,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jL8_I","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-28T14:15:23Z","updated_at":"2026-01-28T14:15:23Z","body":"Which compiler do you use for Godot, and what build options exactly?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3811561416/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3811676444","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115508#issuecomment-3811676444","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115508","id":3811676444,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jMZEc","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-28T14:37:00Z","updated_at":"2026-01-28T14:38:29Z","body":"I can reproduce a slow binutils `addr2line` on my system, with a binary compiled with GCC 15.2.1 on Fedora 43 with `scons dev_build=yes dev_mode=yes linker=mold scu_build=all cache_path=/home/akien/.scons_cache/godot/ fast_unsafe=yes`.\n\n```\n$ cat main.gd \nextends MainLoop\n\nfunc _init():\n        OS.crash(\"hi\")\n```\n\nRunning this, it takes 0m38.188s with binutils addr2line.\n\nI installed [gimli's `addr2line` wrapper](https://github.com/gimli-rs/addr2line?tab=readme-ov-file#performance) (`cargo install addr2line --features=\"bin\"`) and add `~/.cargo/bin` to my `PATH`, so it takes precedence over `/usr/bin/addr2line`, it takes 0m1.976s instead.\n\n|binary|time|\n|---|---|\n|binutils `addr2line`|38.2s|\n|`llvm-addr2line`|2.2s|\n|gimli `addr2line`|2.0s|\n\nSince `llvm-addr2line` is likely to be more common than a Rust crate, we should probably test for existence of `llvm-addr2line` first, then fallback to `addr2line` (which can be either binutils or gimli depending on the user system).\n\nCC @bruvzg \n\n---\n\nBTW, if you run the build through `gdb` (presumably also `lldb`), getting the backtrace is significantly faster than what our crash handler gets with `addr2line`.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3811676444/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3811707268","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115508#issuecomment-3811707268","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115508","id":3811707268,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jMgmE","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-28T14:43:05Z","updated_at":"2026-01-28T14:43:05Z","body":"> Since llvm-addr2line is likely to be more common than a Rust crate, we should probably test for existence of llvm-addr2line first, then fallback to addr2line (which can be either binutils or gimli depending on the user system).\n\nA bit under a minute is what I usually get with default `addr2line`. Checking LLVM (or both LLVM and rust) version first make sense. I'll take a look tomorrow.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3811707268/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]